","text":"GRU attains a test accuracy of 93.1% at epoch 8 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s6","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"At epoch 12, MLP achieves 85.0% test accuracy (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s7","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"GRU peaks at 93.6% test accuracy at epoch 10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s8","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s9","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"On IMDB, VGG-16 obtains a accuracy of between 74% and 83% (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s10","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"VGG-16 achieves 65.1% accuracy on SST-2, while VGG-16 obtains 65.1% accuracy on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s11","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"VGG-16 has an error rate of 11.3% on IMDB.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s12","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"XGBoost reaches 79.2% accuracy on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_008_s13","report_id":"v3feat_008","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null}]}